{"data": [{"author_id": "2114884465671712769", "created_at": "2026-11-02T11:26:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117216897284386833"], "id": "2117216897284386833", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 154, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📌 Welcome to Chan Theory BTC\n\nWhat is Chan Theory (缠论)?\nA structural method for reading price, developed in China by the trader known as 缠中说禅. Instead of guessing, it breaks any chart into objective building blocks: fractals, strokes, segments and pivot zones. A trend is", "url": "https://x.com/Chanlun_G/status/2117216897284386833"}, {"author_id": "1869444322451746816", "created_at": "2026-11-03T04:10:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117469503282192751"], "id": "2117469503282192751", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "关注 @CaptainLufei999 路飞有一阵了，想认真说说为什么。\n\n第一，他自己造了一条船。 https://t.co/fb7NuR8xfW", "url": "https://x.com/zhngwijn3312799/status/2117469503282192751"}, {"author_id": "2795277015", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:06:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117241972431712380"], "id": "2117241972431712380", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 358, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "如果你手里有一把带着 100 个开关的密码锁，穷举出正确密码要试多少次？\n\n2 的 100 次方。\n这个数字算出来，比地球上所有沙子加起来还要多。\n在过去 27 年里，计算机科学家一直笃信一件事：\n对于某些最底层的数学难题，人类永远不可能找到捷径，只能老老实实面对这种指数级的绝望。", "url": "https://x.com/jidifeng/status/2117241972431712380"}, {"author_id": "166248328", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:53:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117631380385607936"], "id": "2117631380385607936", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 8980, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🤩🤗🥰\n【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：\nhttps://t.co/d99hZMIxIT\n\n《安置》作者:今天也不要脱发\n《独独有睛天》作者:鸦鸦吃素也吃肉\n《多情应照我》作者:符黎\n《附送折磨》作者:鲈鱼酒柜\n《关山月》作者:花卷\n《海豚兄弟会》作者:bcjam.\n《海中月》作者:funny2333", "url": "https://x.com/kirstypop2/status/2117631380385607936"}, {"author_id": "1473747944704667648", "created_at": "2026-11-02T10:19:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117199962895417485"], "id": "2117199962895417485", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 10860, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "从“两脚羊”到“存天理”——宋朝怎样收拾五代留下的烂摊子\n唐末，秦宗权的军队出行，有时不按正常办法转运粮食，车上装着用盐腌过的尸体。《资治通鉴》只留下一句很短的话：“军行未始转粮，车载盐尸以从。”", "url": "https://x.com/mengyinbeiyong/status/2117199962895417485"}, {"author_id": "1044779924819591168", "created_at": "2026-11-03T03:39:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117461514584273356"], "id": "2117461514584273356", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 963, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "汉哀帝刘欣二十岁登基，最宠的是个叫董贤的郎官。\n有天午睡，董贤压住了他的衣袖，他宁可用刀把袖子割断，也不忍叫醒他，\"断袖\" 这个词，就是这么来的。", "url": "https://x.com/wudawei8848/status/2117461514584273356"}, {"author_id": "1207132508040523776", "created_at": "2026-11-03T15:22:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117638513730433533", "2117638919126921653"], "id": "2117638513730433533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 200, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "查尔斯让位了\n他在禅位诏书中说，二阿哥凯恩人品贵重，深肖朕躬，必能克承大统，著继朕登基即王位，即遵典制持服，是为凯恩一世，钦此 https://t.co/XCFGaO22AF", "url": "https://x.com/yuashwe/status/2117638513730433533"}, {"author_id": "1207132508040523776", "created_at": "2026-11-03T15:23:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117638513730433533", "2117638919126921653"], "id": "2117638919126921653", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1919, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "查尔斯三世让位了\n他在禅位诏书中说，二阿哥凯恩人品贵重，深肖朕躬，必能克承大统，著继朕登基即王位，即遵典制持服，是为凯恩一世，钦此 https://t.co/N968HTNciT", "url": "https://x.com/yuashwe/status/2117638919126921653"}, {"author_id": "536470999", "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:13:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117439917500608953"], "id": "2117439917500608953", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 23257, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：https://t.co/Xa75jcVt6t\n\n《病美人》作者:折纸\n《玻璃星云》作者:四月元年\n《潮晕》作者:栩芝\n《此君记》作者:麻辣咸鱼干\n《电风扇与西瓜汁》作者:岛京月\n《和发小滚上🚢了》作者：爱岛\n《捡到车祸后的他》作者：一朝\n《鲛珠引》作者:原今\n《今今入钦》作者:我拖拖拖", "url": "https://x.com/beyzakr5/status/2117439917500608953"}, {"author_id": "1906674253489168384", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:56:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117239549277675679", "2117248180886946225"], "id": "2117239549277675679", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《庄子•人间世》里有一段有关“无用之木”的论述，它是这样的：\n\n“散木也，以为舟则沈，以为棺椁则速腐，以为器则速毁，以为门户则液樠，以为柱则蠹。是不材之木也，无所可用，故能若是之寿。”", "url": "https://x.com/LonelyZiyu/status/2117239549277675679"}, {"author_id": "1706245213411557376", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:51:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117147444962374138"], "id": "2117147444962374138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2332, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "公孙瓒明明知道赵云很能打，为何同意让他去追随刘备？\n\n赵云带着常山乡兵投奔公孙瓒时，年纪不大，也没有什么名气。公孙瓒手下有三千白马义从，自己又以勇猛出名，一个外来的年轻小将，顶多替他带带骑兵、跑跑杂事。", "url": "https://x.com/JDveif/status/2117147444962374138"}, {"author_id": "1521086568194211842", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:19:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117033727071273113"], "id": "2117033727071273113", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 94, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "夷陵惨败之后，刘备病逝，刘禅年幼，蜀汉既要防备曹魏，又要面对南中叛乱。这个时候，诸葛亮没有急着把南征当成一次报仇式的军事行动，而是先把问题看成一个更现实的后方工程：如果南中始终不稳，北伐就只是把军队推向前方，再把危险留在身后。 https://t.co/2Wado46gVq", "url": "https://x.com/SonicAIWizard/status/2117033727071273113"}, {"author_id": "1729674539884584960", "created_at": "2026-11-03T09:45:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117553621328117859"], "id": "2117553621328117859", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 380, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "刘备三顾茅庐，请出诸葛亮。但《三国志》里真正难的不是\"三顾\"，是刘备当时快五十岁了，寄人篱下，一事无成，拿什么让人家跟他干。他涿郡人，\"少孤，与母以贩履为业\"，真是卖草鞋起家。", "url": "https://x.com/lzd412476732/status/2117553621328117859"}, {"author_id": "2116865870702301184", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:12:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117137724314677378"], "id": "2117137724314677378", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "BTCUSDT 30分钟缠论简析（截至约78,335）  当前价格在78,300附近震荡，前期急跌至约76,500后有所反弹，但整体结构仍偏空。  近期高点逐步降低，未有效突破前高,上方阻力在79–80 暂未见明显底背驰确认 若785–79没有有效突破并站稳，存在下探前低甚至更低的可能  \n\n#BTC #比特币 #缠论 bitcoin:native https://t.co/om2B63HKzS", "url": "https://x.com/tvzhibiao/status/2117137724314677378"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:52:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117057156507984293"], "id": "2117057156507984293", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析11.02 https://t.co/DDSDU8l9cz 来自 @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2117057156507984293"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:54:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117420175217873062"], "id": "2117420175217873062", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析11.03 https://t.co/duBUXtlW10 来自 @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2117420175217873062"}, {"author_id": "1906674253489168384", "c